This directory vendors the core EpiCare environment and reference policies.

Source: https://github.com/Grosenick-Lab-Cornell/EpiCare (compared with
`main` at commit b4288ec, 2025-11-08)
Authors: Mason Hargrave, Alex Spaeth, and Logan Grosenick (EpiCare paper,
NeurIPS 2024 Datasets and Benchmarks).
